          "description": "Clairey has been chosen to lead the Petal Parade, a special celebration in Luminella. She wants everything to go smoothly, but when the big moment arrives, the Petal Pals are missing. With her friend Lulu and her ladybug companion Dot, Clairey sets off to find them. Their search takes them through cottages, forests, and shimmering groves, where Clairey learns to listen closely and move gently with her friends. A soft, sweet adventure full of heart.",
